//       volume keys.
//     - Bundled Kokoro (PiperTTSManager.ts → expo-av): read fresh per
//       playback in `playWavBase64`, passed to
//       `Audio.Sound.createAsync({ ..., volume })`. Slider changes
//       between utterances take effect on the next sentence.
